{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/4012ebf97f992521b0882b7f7b6b771e.webp?t=1761244282\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/06abe0479d615fe616afa6f3ed8340d2.poster.avif?t=1761244282\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/06abe0479d615fe616afa6f3ed8340d2.webm?t=1761244282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/06abe0479d615fe616afa6f3ed8340d2.mp4?t=1761244282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Fantasy Console</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mnemonimov</strong> (pronounced as <i>ne-mo-ni-move</i>)<strong>\u00a0</strong>is a programming sandbox that recreates the experience of developing games for early consoles. Instead of writing high-level code and rendering colorful graphics, you'll be working with <strong>low-level</strong> concepts, writing instructions in <strong>assembly</strong> and rendering to a monochrome screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/7aa96e2bd7fb8670c50be1e1db140e32.webp?t=1761244282\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Specs and Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32-bit register-based virtual machine with a bespoke assembly language.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixed-ISA design with\u00a0RISC-style explicit memory access and a rich instruction set for development convenience, including floating-point operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for labels, constants, and data directives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated code editor with syntax highlighting and detailed error reporting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Debugger with step-by-step execution, breakpoints, and the ability to inspect registers and memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in command-line interface for managing projects and configuring settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-bit monochrome display with 320\u00d7240 resolution at 60 Hz.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System calls for polling user input, drawing to the screen, printing to the terminal, and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/54a501534cef23fd89c95e7b90ae8f96.webp?t=1761244282\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Important Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mnemonimov is not a learning tool.</strong> It will not teach you programming logic, assembly, or game development. <strong>There are no tutorials</strong>, levels, guides, or hints. Note that the included documentation is strictly technical, describing the assembly language and the virtual machine behavior, not how to learn programming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mnemonimov</strong> is focused entirely on programming and debugging. It does not include (and will never include) a sprite editor, sound editor, map editor, or any kind of asset creation tool.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854110?t=1761244282","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/8fbd63b7cb1a91a543d9e1f5b75440bd2b78e4c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761244282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/fef039fba0948b3acafa3ad2a913b317ac3e809e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761244282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/fef039fba0948b3acafa3ad2a913b317ac3e809e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761244282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/946f9fab0911f52a74a187b160b76498.avif?t=1761244282\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/4012ebf97f992521b0882b7f7b6b771e.webp?t=1761244282\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/06abe0479d615fe616afa6f3ed8340d2.poster.avif?t=1761244282\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/06abe0479d615fe616afa6f3ed8340d2.webm?t=1761244282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/06abe0479d615fe616afa6f3ed8340d2.mp4?t=1761244282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Fantasy Console</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mnemonimov</strong> (pronounced as <i>ne-mo-ni-move</i>)<strong>\u00a0</strong>is a programming sandbox that recreates the experience of developing games for early consoles. Instead of writing high-level code and rendering colorful graphics, you'll be working with <strong>low-level</strong> concepts, writing instructions in <strong>assembly</strong> and rendering to a monochrome screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/7aa96e2bd7fb8670c50be1e1db140e32.webp?t=1761244282\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Specs and Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32-bit register-based virtual machine with a bespoke assembly language.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixed-ISA design with\u00a0RISC-style explicit memory access and a rich instruction set for development convenience, including floating-point operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for labels, constants, and data directives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated code editor with syntax highlighting and detailed error reporting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Debugger with step-by-step execution, breakpoints, and the ability to inspect registers and memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in command-line interface for managing projects and configuring settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-bit monochrome display with 320\u00d7240 resolution at 60 Hz.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System calls for polling user input, drawing to the screen, printing to the terminal, and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/extras/54a501534cef23fd89c95e7b90ae8f96.webp?t=1761244282\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Important Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mnemonimov is not a learning tool.</strong> It will not teach you programming logic, assembly, or game development. <strong>There are no tutorials</strong>, levels, guides, or hints. Note that the included documentation is strictly technical, describing the assembly language and the virtual machine behavior, not how to learn programming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mnemonimov</strong> is focused entirely on programming and debugging. It does not include (and will never include) a sprite editor, sound editor, map editor, or any kind of asset creation tool.</p>","developers":["Reverie Foundry"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854110/36a3d2a22a3ea504b6604854a759aa37a36554ea/header.jpg?t=1761244282","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Reverie Foundry. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854110/1504046058/02ab9f623119aaa81000df61073c90ca929f8f6f/1753794598/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756403194","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854110/1504046058/02ab9f623119aaa81000df61073c90ca929f8f6f/1753794598/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756403194","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854110/1504046058/02ab9f623119aaa81000df61073c90ca929f8f6f/1753794598/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756403194","id":257174999,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174999/movie480.mp4?